==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|набира́ть|-ся}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|набира́ться}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-набираться.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|набира́ться|impf|pf=набра́ться}}

# to [[gather]], to [[accumulate]] {{q|of several people}}
# to [[pile up]], to [[accumulate]] {{q|of debts, work, etc.}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[collect]], to [[summon up]] {{+obj|ru|gen<an emotion>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''набира́ться''' [[храбрость|хра́брости]]|to pluck/summon up one's courage}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''набира́ться''' [[дух|ду́ху]]|to take heart}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''набира́ться''' [[новый|но́вых]] [[сила|сил]]|summon up fresh energy}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''набира́ться''' [[наглость|на́глости]]|to have the audacity/nerve|q={{+obj|ru|inf<to do something>}}}}
# to [[amount]], to [[add up]] {{+obj|ru|gen<to something>}}
# to [[experience]], to [[undergo]] {{+obj|ru|gen<an emotion>}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[learn]], to [[pick up]] {{+obj|ru|gen<a skill, etc.>}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''набира́ться''' [[опыт|о́пыта]]|to gain/accumulate experience}}
# {{lb|ru|colloquial}} to [[be]] [[full]], to [[tank up]] on [[alcohol]], to [[load up]], to [[get]] [[wasted]]/[[drunk]]
# {{infl of|ru|набира́ть||pass}}

